{"c":"421004","n":"BĚLÁ 2","t":"M","s":"JČ","o":"Pelhřimov","url":"421004-bela-2-k2yde","stav":"2026-10-07","popis":"Přítok Hejlovky – Želivky. Revír tvoří nádrž:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nStráž\tv k. ú. Pelhřimov\t8 ha\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n(GPS 49°25'34.153\"N, 15°12'23.492\"E)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\nPři lovu na nástražní rybičku povoleno používat pouze celé nástražní rybičky, jejichž délka je minimálně 20 cm. Počet ponechaných dravých ryb (štika nebo candát nebo sumec) je limitován na jeden kus denně. Jelec jesen a mník jednovousý jsou celoročně hájeni. Na revíru je vhodné místo pro handicapované rybáře (GPS 49°25'24.966\"N, 15°12'18.432\"E).\tV prostoru pláže označeném cedulemi platí zákaz rybolovu v období od 15. 6. do 15. 9.","delka":0,"rozloha":8,"lat":49.424853,"lon":15.205825,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/pelhrimov","mo_tel":"","mo_mail":"pelhrimov@mo.jcus.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","h":"05:00–22:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":45,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-06-16","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":70,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan po